peedup": 6.99, "arithmetic_mean_speedup": 10.55, "min_speedup": 3.95, "max_speedup": 39.04, "decision": "keep", "cumulative_evaluations": 1, "skills_used": ["KernelWiki"], "notes": "Baseline correct and new best. H1/H2/H4 confirmed: 21/21 pass, geomean 6.99x. Regime pattern: tiny/micro cases (17 of 21, total_q<=92) are launch-bound and cluster tightly at ~3.95-4.6x (sol ~0.095-0.105ms regardless of size => fixed launch overhead dominates); large cases (#5,#6,#20 ~12.5-13.5k tok) hit 28.7-32.1x and the 982-tok #17 hits 39x. Since geomean is tiny-case dominated, the highest-value next move is Perf branch B (size-bucketed launch config: pick smaller BLOCK_M/num_warps/num_stages for tiny total_q to cut the ~0.095ms fixed launch cost) rather than large-case tiling. All sol times on tiny cases are ~0.095ms => the per-launch fixed cost is the target. Next parent: c001."}
{"id": "c002", "parent": "c001", "source_sha256": "ea47b71b2a72e9498f0baa5fead365fc2e4864cd85f83946ae175689f45ad75c", "hypothesis": "Removing the int(q_lens.max().item()) device->host sync (a full stream round-trip) on launch-bound cases will cut the ~0.095ms fixed host cost that dominates the tiny/small workloads (total_q<=92, majority of the geomean). For total_q<=BLOCK_M every sequence fits in one m-block so n_m_blocks=1 with no sync; large cases keep the c001 single-sync path.", "change_from_parent": "launch plumbing only: skip the device->host max-reduction/.item() sync when total_q<=BLOCK_M (n_m_blocks=1). Triton kernel body byte-identical to c001; output/lse init unchanged (zeros/-inf).", "config": {"BLOCK_M": 128, "BLOCK_N": 64, "num_warps": 8, "num_stages": 2, "grid": "V1-dense; sync-free for total_q<=128", "qk_precision": "bf16-dot-fp32-accum", "launch": "sync-free-small", "host_syncs": "0 for total_q<=128, else 1", "causal_skip": true}, "validation": {"correct": true, "workloads_passed": 21, "workloads_total": 21, "failures": [], "tolerance": {"atol": 0.01, "rtol": 0.01, "matched_ratio": 0.99}}, "per_workload": [{"uuid": "f7a038e9-6c18-4fd6-9b79-e349a4c79bd8", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 7, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 6.92}, {"uuid": "f4c23a33-b16b-4ee8-bb86-440562adf047", "regime": "micro", "axes": {"total_q": 1, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 6.26}, {"uuid": "bad384fa-037d-474f-9a09-0e9f1bb8f43e", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.05}, {"uuid": "2068cdff-fad7-43d3-b018-490349ad9776", "regime": "small", "axes": {"total_q": 81, "len_indptr": 3}, "correct": true, "speedup": 12.68}, {"uuid": "6f3e1bfe-2209-4921-9be4-beed5c9744cb", "regime": "large", "axes": {"total_q": 13557, "len_indptr": 26}, "correct": true, "speedup": 32.69}, {"uuid": "adefedc4-d82a-43ca-800e-51557b08b446", "regime": "large", "axes": {"total_q": 12845, "len_indptr": 37}, "correct": true, "speedup": 32.21}, {"uuid": "fab48473-c925-43b8-90b8-3110ede3e6a7", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 7, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.07}, {"uuid": "3a919718-bdfb-4030-8771-7e2cca27ada7", "regime": "micro", "axes": {"total_q": 1, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 6.44}, {"uuid": "32f5e961-dd46-4ac3-bb3d-bbc2e30053db", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.17}, {"uuid": "daa2d149-ff35-4038-8195-eb293f8566cd", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 6.94}, {"uuid": "ef683298-131d-4c81-9d1d-4db82b7f7896", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 18, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.10}, {"uuid": "568a6016-6234-4700-ae5e-061593e16640", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 18, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.28}, {"uuid": "b8f94163-51d0-4a6f-8af1-6721221cfd67", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 7, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.15}, {"uuid": "bdc49f9e-f294-40c8-925e-a3b3ac6fc335", "regime": "micro", "axes": {"total_q": 1, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 6.29}, {"uuid": "da9042ea-dc64-44aa-ba6d-1a90b834f6d8", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.07}, {"uuid": "58701318-6136-4577-afb1-7a3b9418bd79", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.25}, {"uuid": "2328b031-69cc-4217-8e14-e341dd418733", "regime": "small", "axes": {"total_q": 982, "len_indptr": 16}, "correct": true, "speedup": 40.75}, {"uuid": "012bb8e4-3c30-414f-ab5e-8d63cbbce70f", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 71, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.05}, {"uuid": "370287f0-5dc3-4c0a-9a00-9162fb2ddbd4", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 71, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.25}, {"uuid": "7a08a0f6-7dd4-4de9-bb5b-847c51969faa", "regime": "large", "axes": {"total_q": 12571, "len_indptr": 11}, "correct": true, "speedup": 28.42}, {"uuid": "dc8c1d18-3976-48c0-bdf1-f9bcb999cdd4", "regime": "small", "axes": {"total_q": 92, "len_indptr": 6}, "correct": true, "speedup": 26.83}], "geomean_speedup": 10.27, "arithmetic_mean_speedup": 13.23, "min_speedup": 6.26, "max_speedup": 40.75, "decision": "keep", "cumulative_evaluations": 2, "skills_used": ["KernelWiki"], "notes": "Big win, new best: geomean 6.99->10.27x, 21/21 correct. Removing the .item() sync cut tiny/small sol time ~0.095->0.060ms; tiny/micro speedups jumped ~4x->6.3-7.3x. #21 (total_q=92) jumped 16.97->26.83x because 92<=128 => now sync-free single-block. Large cases unchanged within noise (they still take the 1-sync path). Remaining headroom is now GPU-bound, not host-bound: (a) tiny cases still ~0.060ms => a residual fixed cost (single kernel launch + zeros/full init kernels for output/lse); could try torch.empty since kernel writes every owned row, saving 2 memset launches. (b) large cases (#5,#6,#20 ~28-33x) are the GPU-efficiency frontier -> tile/stages/warps sweep (branch A) or GQA kv-reuse. Next parent: c002. Candidate c003 idea: torch.empty (no memset) for output/lse to shave remaining tiny-case launch overhead, since every output row is written by exactly one program under mask_m and zero-length seqs produce no rows in the packed layout."}
{"id": "c003", "parent": "c002", "source_sha256": "fbdf01cdc822b35085cbcec82cf1d86aee73954a8a7823d0fa9d006f9ad8899f", "hypothesis": "Tiny cases were still ~0.060ms after removing the host sync; the residual fixed cost is the kernel launch plus the two zeros/full init-memset kernels. In the packed ragged layout every output/lse row is fully written by exactly one program per head (zero-length seqs produce no rows), so torch.empty is correct and drops 2 memset launches per call, further cutting tiny-case latency.", "change_from_parent": "allocation only: torch.zeros/torch.full -> torch.empty for output/lse on the main path (empty-batch/max_seqlen==0 guards keep zeros/full since no kernel runs). Kernel body and grid logic byte-identical to c002.", "config": {"BLOCK_M": 128, "BLOCK_N": 64, "num_warps": 8, "num_stages": 2, "grid": "V1-dense; sync-free for total_q<=128", "qk_precision": "bf16-dot-fp32-accum", "launch": "sync-free-small + no-memset (torch.empty)", "host_syncs": "0 for total_q<=128, else 1", "causal_skip": true}, "validation": {"correct": true, "workloads_passed": 21, "workloads_total": 21, "failures": [], "tolerance": {"atol": 0.01, "rtol": 0.01, "matched_ratio": 0.99}}, "per_workload": [{"uuid": "f7a038e9-6c18-4fd6-9b79-e349a4c79bd8", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 7, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.00}, {"uuid": "f4c23a33-b16b-4ee8-bb86-440562adf047", "regime": "micro", "axes": {"total_q": 1, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.26}, {"uuid": "bad384fa-037d-474f-9a09-0e9f1bb8f43e", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.52}, {"uuid": "2068cdff-fad7-43d3-b018-490349ad9776", "regime": "small", "axes": {"total_q": 81, "len_indptr": 3}, "correct": true, "speedup": 14.57}, {"uuid": "6f3e1bfe-2209-4921-9be4-beed5c9744cb", "regime": "large", "axes": {"total_q": 13557, "len_indptr": 26}, "correct": true, "speedup": 31.54}, {"uuid": "adefedc4-d82a-43ca-800e-51557b08b446", "regime": "large", "axes": {"total_q": 12845, "len_indptr": 37}, "correct": true, "speedup": 33.44}, {"uuid": "fab48473-c925-43b8-90b8-3110ede3e6a7", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 7, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.14}, {"uuid": "3a919718-bdfb-4030-8771-7e2cca27ada7", "regime": "micro", "axes": {"total_q": 1, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.30}, {"uuid": "32f5e961-dd46-4ac3-bb3d-bbc2e30053db", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.22}, {"uuid": "daa2d149-ff35-4038-8195-eb293f8566cd", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.25}, {"uuid": "ef683298-131d-4c81-9d1d-4db82b7f7896", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 18, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.33}, {"uuid": "568a6016-6234-4700-ae5e-061593e16640", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 18, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.40}, {"uuid": "b8f94163-51d0-4a6f-8af1-6721221cfd67", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 7, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.18}, {"uuid": "bdc49f9e-f294-40c8-925e-a3b3ac6fc335", "regime": "micro", "axes": {"total_q": 1, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.46}, {"uuid": "da9042ea-dc64-44aa-ba6d-1a90b834f6d8", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.38}, {"uuid": "58701318-6136-4577-afb1-7a3b9418bd79", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.35}, {"uuid": "2328b031-69cc-4217-8e14-e341dd418733", "regime": "small", "axes": {"total_q": 982, "len_indptr": 16}, "correct": true, "speedup": 42.80}, {"uuid": "012bb8e4-3c30-414f-ab5e-8d63cbbce70f", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 71, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 8.25}, {"uuid": "370287f0-5dc3-4c0a-9a00-9162fb2ddbd4", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 71, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 9.10}, {"uuid": "7a08a0f6-7dd4-4de9-bb5